%% Activity diagram: payment window and receipt
flowchart TD
  A([Payment window opens]) --> B[vat_breakdown: base, 5% VAT, total]
  B --> C[Show prices in preferred currency]
  C --> D{User changes currency?}
  D -- yes --> E[format_money with fixed rate] --> D
  D -- no --> F[Pick Visa, Mastercard or bank transfer]
  F --> G[Form filled with demo details]
  G --> H[Press Pay]
  H --> I{verify_demo_payment: all fields match?}
  I -- no --> J[Show which field does not match] --> G
  I -- yes --> K[Create TXN id and close window]
  K --> L[Booking saved by the server]
  L --> M[Build receipt lines]
  M --> N{Download PDF?}
  N -- yes --> O[build_pdf and save to Downloads without overwriting]
  N -- no --> P([Close])
  O --> P
